  "notes": "Interim 100-card mono-black Commander deck for the Foundations Wretched Ranks precon (official list unreleased; Ruling M3-P). Commanded by Ghoulcaller Gisa: {B}{T} sac a creature to make X 2/2 Zombies where X is its power, so the deck is zombie lords and cheap fodder with sacrifice payoffs (Zulaport Cutthroat, Blood Artist, Carrion Feeder, Bloodthrone Vampire, Nantuko Husk, Bone Splinters, Victimize, Village Rites). Removal is black's classic suite (Doom Blade, Go for the Throat, Hero's Downfall, Murder and friends), draw is Sign in Blood/Night's Whisper/Phyrexian Arena plus tutors, and the top end (Grave Titan, Gurmag Angler, Butcher of Malakir) closes. Colour identity is exactly black: every non-Swamp land and artifact is colourless-identity, and no card carries a coloured symbol outside black.",
